   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Flash-bright: the brightest street look (median ~128), red-warm shadows (41,30,28), bright highlights (218,213,206), reds 45% of colour mass with a magenta bin (10%), skin hue 23, overall saturation 0.27. Best for: Daylight-flash candids, food and decor, bright beach and pool frames, guests and crowds in sun, humorous documentary. Bright and frank.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
